---
title: Flujo de Upload de Contactos (Excel)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Usuario
    participant Controller as PersonaController
    participant DtoMapper as PersonaDtoMapper
    participant Service as PersonaService
    participant UseCase as UploadContactosUseCaseImpl
    participant FileReader as ExcelContactoUploadFileReader
    participant ContactoPort as ContactoServiceAdapter
    participant Validator as ToolServiceMailValidator
    participant PersonaPort as JpaPersonaRepositoryAdapter

    Usuario->>Controller: POST /api/haberes/core/persona/upload (PersonaUploadRequest)
    Controller->>DtoMapper: toUploadedFile(request)
    Controller->>Service: upload(UploadedFile)
    Service->>UseCase: uploadContactos(file)
    UseCase->>FileReader: readContactos(file)
    FileReader-->>UseCase: List~ContactoMail~ (filas del Excel)
    loop por cada fila con legajoId válido
        UseCase->>ContactoPort: findByLegajoId(legajoId)
        ContactoPort-->>UseCase: ContactoMail existente o nuevo
        UseCase->>Validator: isValid(mailPersonal / mailInstitucional)
    end
    UseCase->>ContactoPort: saveAll(contactos)
    UseCase->>PersonaPort: findAllByLegajoIds(legajos)
    PersonaPort-->>UseCase: List~Persona~
    UseCase-->>Controller: List~Persona~ (vía PersonaService)
    Controller-->>Usuario: 200 OK (List~PersonaResponse~)

    Note over UseCase,Validator: Los mails inválidos se descartan y solo se persisten<br/>los contactos con algún mail válido
